{
  "id": "102",
  "title": "Is that my Dad?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2016-03-23",
  "synopsis": "The word 爸爸 means father, but also sounds a bit like “88” in Chinese. In this funny story, we see how Little Ming uses this to get out of an embarrassing situation.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/92/db3309acb512a541e21404fdd8e6fd3d20121a3d.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "是爸爸？还是……？\n\n    一天，小明在街上看到前面有一个人很像他的爸爸，他很高兴，大叫“爸爸，爸爸…”\n    后来，那个人回头，小明发现那个人不是他的爸爸，他有点不好意思，又连忙说：“88、89、90……”",
    "traditional": "是爸爸？還是……？\n\n    一天，小明在街上看到前面有一個人很像他的爸爸，他很高興，大叫“爸爸，爸爸…”\n    後來，那個人回頭，小明發現那個人不是他的爸爸，他有點不好意思，又連忙說：“88、89、90……”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Is that my dad, or…?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，小明在街上看到前面有一个人很像他的爸爸，",
      "traditional": "一天，小明在街上看到前面有一個人很像他的爸爸，",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān xiǎo míng zài jiē shang kàn dào qián miàn yǒu yí ge rén hěn xiàng tā de bà ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "他很高兴，大叫“爸爸，爸爸…”",
      "traditional": "他很高興，大叫“爸爸，爸爸…”",
      "pinyin": "tā hěn gāo xìng dà jiào bà ba bà ba",
      "english": "One day, Little Ming noticed the man in front of him on the street looked a lot like his father."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Excited, he yelled “Daddy, daddy…”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "后来，那个人回头，小明发现那个人不是他的爸爸，",
      "traditional": "後來，那個人回頭，小明發現那個人不是他的爸爸，",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái nà ge rén huí tóu xiǎo míng fā xiàn nà ge rén bú shì tā de bà ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "他有点不好意思，又连忙说：“88、89、90……”",
      "traditional": "他有點不好意思，又連忙說：“88、89、90……”",
      "pinyin": "tā yǒu diǎn bù hǎo yì si yòu lián máng shuō bā bā bā jiǔ jiǔ shí",
      "english": "Then the person turned around, and Little Ming discovered that it wasn’t his dad."
    }
  ],
